p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      <a class=\"sx-talk__call\" href=\"{{u98}}\" data-track=\"sector-business-services-talk-phone\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z\"/></svg><span>{{s99}} <strong>{{s100}}</strong></span></a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Built for business services"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Technology business services teams can rely on"},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Professional and business services run on trust, deadlines and confidential client data. When systems are slow or unavailable, billable time and client confidence are lost."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"WhizzIT keeps your people productive and your client data protected, with responsive support, secure cloud collaboration and cyber security built in."},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"02"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"What you get with WhizzIT"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Heading 2","default":"What you get with WhizzIT"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Secure handling of confidential client data"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"02"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Reliable, always-on systems that protect billable time"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"03"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Secure remote and hybrid working"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 7","default":"04"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 8","default":"Backup and disaster recovery procedures"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 9","default":"05"},{"k":"s17","type":"s","label":"List item 10","default":"Cyber security protection from online threats"},{"k":"s18","type":"s","label":"List item 11","default":"06"},{"k":"s19","type":"s","label":"List item 12","default":"Less downtime, faster resolution, greater productivity"},{"k":"s20","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 7","default":"03"},{"k":"s21","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 8","default":"Consultancies and business services"},{"k":"s22","type":"s","label":"Heading 3","default":"Many clients, one estate, and confidentiality between them"},{"k":"s23","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 9","default":"Firms that work inside other people’s businesses carry a particular obligation: information from one client must not become visible to another, even accidentally, and even when the same consultant works on both. That is a structural requirement rather than a policy statement."},{"k":"s24","type":"s","label":"List item 13","default":"01"},{"k":"s25","type":"s","label":"Heading 4","default":"Separation by design, not by good intentions"},{"k":"s26","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 10","default":"Per-client workspaces, permissions that expire when an engagement ends, and a clear rule for where client material is allowed to live. The alternative, a shared drive that nobody prunes, is where confidentiality quietly breaks down."},{"k":"s27","type":"s","label":"List item 14","default":"02"},{"k":"s28","type":"s","label":"Heading 5","default":"Working on the client’s site and the client’s network"},{"k":"s29","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 11","default":"Consultants routinely connect to guest wireless, use client systems and move between environments in a week. Devices need to be secure enough to be trusted anywhere, which puts the emphasis on the endpoint and on identity rather than on the office perimeter."},{"k":"s30","type":"s","label":"List item 15","default":"03"},{"k":"s31","type":"s","label":"Heading 6","default":"Projects start and stop, so the setup has to as well"},{"k":"s32","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 12","default":"Onboarding and offboarding are constant rather than occasional, and each one is an access decision. Automating joiners and leavers is the difference between a licence bill that reflects reality and one that only grows."},{"k":"s33","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 13","default":"04"},{"k":"s34","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 14","default":"Customer stories"},{"k":"s35","type":"s","label":"Heading 7","default":"What our clients say"},{"k":"s36","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 15","default":"Great IT support company. The WhizzIT team are professional, responsive and easy to work with. Any issues are dealt with quickly and they are never slow to pick up the phone."},{"k":"s37","type":"s","label":"Caption 1","default":"TS"},{"k":"s38","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Tommy Sabine"},{"k":"s39","type":"s","label":"Caption 2","default":"Director, Codeshield"},{"k":"u40","type":"u","label":"Link: See all 15 reviews","default":"https://www.google.com/maps?cid=17055157413191665489"},{"k":"s41","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"See all 15 reviews"},{"k":"s42","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 16","default":"05"},{"k":"s43","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 17","default":"What we do"},{"k":"s44","type":"s","label":"Heading 8","default":"Everything IT, under one roof"},{"k":"s45","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 18","default":"From day-to-day support to cyber security and full projects, we take care of the technology so your team can focus on the work that matters."},{"k":"u46","type":"u","label":"Link: IT Support","default":"/it-support/"},{"k":"s47","type":"s","label":"Bold text 2","default":"IT Support"},{"k":"s48","type":"s","label":"Link text 2","default":"Fast, friendly help when things go wrong."},{"k":"u49","type":"u","label":"Link: Managed Cloud Services","default":"/managed-cloud-services/"},{"k":"s50","type":"s","label":"Bold text 3","default":"Managed Cloud Services"},{"k":"s51","type":"s","label":"Link text 3","default":"Microsoft 365, Azure and Google Workspace, managed end to end."},{"k":"u52","type":"u","label":"Link: Cyber Security","default":"/cyber-security/"},{"k":"s53","type":"s","label":"Bold text 4","default":"Cyber Security"},{"k":"s54","type":"s","label":"Link text 4","default":"Protection aligned to Cyber Essentials best practice."},{"k":"u55","type":"u","label":"Link: Network Management","default":"/network-management/"},{"k":"s56","type":"s","label":"Bold text 5","default":"Network Management"},{"k":"s57","type":"s","label":"Link text 5","default":"Networks designed, built and monitored by our engineers."},{"k":"u58","type":"u","label":"Link: IT Project Management","default":"/it-project-management/"},{"k":"s59","type":"s","label":"Bold text 6","default":"IT Project Management"},{"k":"s60","type":"s","label":"Link text 6","default":"Moves, migrations and upgrades delivered on time."},{"k":"u61","type":"u","label":"Link: All IT services","default":"/it-services/"},{"k":"s62","type":"s","label":"Button 1","default":"All IT services"},{"k":"s63","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 19","default":"06"},{"k":"s64","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 20","default":"Certified & accredited"},{"k":"s65","type":"s","label":"Heading 9","default":"Credentials you can check"},{"k":"i66","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/partners/cyber-essentials.webp\" alt=\"Cyber Essentials certified\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/partners/cyber-essentials.webp"}},{"k":"s67","type":"s","label":"Heading 10","default":"Cyber Essentials certified"},{"k":"s68","type":"s","label":"List item 16","default":"Independently assessed against the UK gover